astBallMaster_Screenshot2.png", "id": "1876173739873412", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393444_1876173743206745_6763138395539482801_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=O-gc2Lym4ZUQ7kNvwES2dQt&_nc_oc=Adlp7JX_KRrfAK75sqJgggxX-N9zSeanTK83glfOHaj2-YwXFnQ1b4NYeSVn-yggsuE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afum9nj6crGvDYYh6iZzvMxZ-HLqbut2oD2pdewiWsuVXg&oe=69983DF3"}, {"file_name": "BlastBallMaster_Screenshot5.png", "id": "1157934832465543", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473400793_1157934839132209_1607817201009102730_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6Wa65ed4HQsQ7kNvwE6ypO0&_nc_oc=Adl97Srt_IpZ-o7bnNQGlcS_qJ6r8PWcKZTz0sjuP4UYGsf90E977mkN64Zv74iDx-U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Aft_VMNm88t0XqUyHMVsLiXJwqCtz7wuucui0tTEQy87Tg&oe=69983E96"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "BlastBallMaster_Logo (2560x1440).png", "id": "1355890215582535", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819281_1355890218915868_2056131209238582864_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tm2qLXDrFx4Q7kNvwGhTtKS&_nc_oc=AdnD_zlDvVZZUWl0wwOYJjHlvawr2yQ1vbekL9UOSsGcUhQYgOri2z8R6erxYm_vHVE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvdjbUcIXXBW-1IbdtQXnNs0FEi3o24D5yAmPIEXng7dQ&oe=69985D3D"}, "display_name": "Blast Ball Master", "keywords": ["ball", "shoot", "bubble", "match3", "puzzle"], "long_description": "Blast Ball Master is a new vision of the old school Zuma game. \nBlast Ball Master is a puzzle game with a new creative idea.\nBlast Ball Master is interactive and immersive game. Be inside VR.\nBlast Ball Master is a good choice for those who love shooting ball game.\n\nUse 4 boosters: Slow, Freeze, Explosion and Backward Moving! \nUse challenges to get free coins!\nEnjoy colorful effects! \nCool fun music!\nTry different VR hands to get an additional bonus.\nTry Blast Ball Master now!  ", "short_descrip